.DS_Store
# Match .env at ANY depth. A bare `.env` only excludes the context root, so
# deploy/selfhost/.env (created by the quickstart) would still be COPYed into
# the pew-selfhost:local image — leaking real secrets into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.rqlite-auth.json
# Backup archives and their staging dirs (backup.sh default output lands in
# deploy/selfhost/). Same rationale as **/.env: the archive holds every
# password_hash/api_key, and build contexts are the repo root, so a build
# running while an archive exists would bake it into an image layer.
**/backup-*.db
**/.pew-backup.*/
logo.png
scripts/resize-logos.py
